#{\footnote # formatting}${\footnote $ Formatting Text}K{\footnote K Formatting Text}+{\footnote + procedures:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Formatting Text}\par
\pard\li120\sa60\sb60{\b To format characters}\par
\pard\li360\fi-240\sa60 1.\tab Select the text.\par
2.\tab Choose Bold, Italic or another format from the Character menu.\par
\pard\li120\sa120 Paragraph formats apply to the paragraphs the selection touches; Document settings to the whole document.\par
\page
#{\footnote # pictures}${\footnote $ Adding Pictures}K{\footnote K Adding Pictures}+{\footnote + procedures:020}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Adding Pictures}\par
\pard\li120\sa120 Copy a picture, then choose Paste in Write to insert it as a separate paragraph. Use Move Picture or Size Picture to adjust it.\par
\page
